          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "show_placeholder_image": true,
            "reviewer_1": "Mark H.",
            "text_1": "<p>I switched because I was tired of cheap handles and overpriced refills. The shave is smooth, controlled, and comfortable. No irritation, no nonsense. It just works.</p>",
